{"seq":1,"slug":"design-tokens","title":"设计令牌","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/css-and-visual-engineering/design-systems/design-tokens","wordCount":559,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"设计令牌\">设计令牌</h1><h2 id=\"问题背景\">问题背景</h2><p>设计令牌（Design Tokens）是设计系统的原子层——将颜色、间距、字体、阴影等视觉属性抽象为平台无关的键值对。它们是设计师与开发者之间的&quot;合约&quot;，确保品牌一致性的同时支持多平台（Web、iOS、Android）输出。Style Dictionary 是主流的令牌处理工具链。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>设计令牌把视觉决策抽象为<strong>平台无关的键值对</strong>，并按语义分三层：原始值（primitive，如 <code>blue-500</code>）、别名层（semantic，如 <code>color-primary</code>）与组件层（component，如 <code>button-bg</code>）。上游只维护一份源令牌，通过 Style Dictionary 之类的工具编译成 CSS 变量、Swift、Android XML 等目标平台产物。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;设计工具 (Figma)&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;设计令牌 (JSON)&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;Style Dictionary&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;CSS 变量&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E[&quot;iOS Swift&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; F[&quot;Android XML&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; G[&quot;Tailwind Config&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"设计工具 (Figma)\"] --&gt; B[\"设计令牌 (JSON)\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"Style Dictionary\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"CSS 变量\"]\n    C --&gt; E[\"iOS Swift\"]\n    C --&gt; F[\"Android XML\"]\n    C --&gt; G[\"Tailwind Config\"]</pre><h2 id=\"令牌分类\">令牌分类</h2><p>设计令牌按抽象层级分为三层：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>名称</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全局令牌</td>\n<td>Global / Primitive</td>\n<td><code>blue-500: #3b82f6</code></td>\n<td>原始值，与用途无关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语义令牌</td>\n<td>Semantic / Alias</td>\n<td><code>color-primary: {blue-500}</code></td>\n<td>描述用途，引用全局令牌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>组件令牌</td>\n<td>Component</td>\n<td><code>button-bg: {color-primary}</code></td>\n<td>特定组件专用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;color&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;blue&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;500&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;#3b82f6&quot;, &quot;type&quot;: &quot;color&quot; }&#10;    }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;semantic&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;color&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;primary&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;{color.blue.500}&quot; },&#10;      &quot;bg&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;default&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;#ffffff&quot; },&#10;        &quot;subtle&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;#f8fafc&quot; }&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;component&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;button&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;bg&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;{semantic.color.primary}&quot; },&#10;      &quot;radius&quot;: { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;{size.radius.md}&quot; }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"color\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"blue\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"500\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"#3b82f6\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"color\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"semantic\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"color\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"primary\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{color.blue.500}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"bg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"default\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"#ffffff\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"subtle\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"#f8fafc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"component\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"button\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"bg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{semantic.color.primary}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"radius\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{size.radius.md}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    G[&quot;全局令牌 blue-500: #3b82f6&quot;] --&gt; S[&quot;语义令牌 color-primary&quot;]&#10;    S --&gt; C[&quot;组件令牌 button-bg&quot;]&#10;    G2[&quot;全局令牌 radius-8: 8px&quot;] --&gt; S2[&quot;语义令牌 radius-md&quot;]&#10;    S2 --&gt; C2[&quot;组件令牌 button-radius&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    G[\"全局令牌 blue-500: #3b82f6\"] --&gt; S[\"语义令牌 color-primary\"]\n    S --&gt; C[\"组件令牌 button-bg\"]\n    G2[\"全局令牌 radius-8: 8px\"] --&gt; S2[\"语义令牌 radius-md\"]\n    S2 --&gt; C2[\"组件令牌 button-radius\"]</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 三层结构的好处是：改变品牌色只需修改全局令牌到语义令牌的映射，所有组件自动更新。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"命名规范\">命名规范</h2><h3 id=\"推荐命名模式\">推荐命名模式</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"{category}-{property}-{variant}-{state}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>{category}-{property}-{variant}-{state}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;color-text-primary&quot;: &quot;#0f172a&quot;,&#10;  &quot;color-text-secondary&quot;: &quot;#475569&quot;,&#10;  &quot;color-text-disabled&quot;: &quot;#94a3b8&quot;,&#10;  &quot;color-bg-default&quot;: &quot;#ffffff&quot;,&#10;  &quot;color-bg-subtle&quot;: &quot;#f8fafc&quot;,&#10;  &quot;color-bg-inverse&quot;: &quot;#0f172a&quot;,&#10;  &quot;color-border-default&quot;: &quot;#e2e8f0&quot;,&#10;  &quot;color-border-focus&quot;: &quot;#3b82f6&quot;,&#10;  &quot;space-xs&quot;: &quot;4px&quot;,&#10;  &quot;space-sm&quot;: &quot;8px&quot;,&#10;  &quot;space-md&quot;: &quot;16px&quot;,&#10;  &quot;space-lg&quot;: &quot;24px&quot;,&#10;  &quot;space-xl&quot;: &quot;32px&quot;,&#10;  &quot;font-size-sm&quot;: &quot;0.875rem&quot;,&#10;  &quot;font-size-md&quot;: &quot;1rem&quot;,&#10;  &quot;font-size-lg&quot;: &quot;1.25rem&quot;,&#10;  &quot;radius-sm&quot;: &quot;4px&quot;,&#10;  &quot;radius-md&quot;: &quot;8px&quot;,&#10;  &quot;radius-lg&quot;: &quot;12px&quot;,&#10;  &quot;radius-full&quot;: &quot;9999px&quot;,&#10;  &quot;shadow-sm&quot;: &quot;0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.05)&quot;,&#10;  &quot;shadow-md&quot;: &quot;0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1)&quot;,&#10;  &quot;shadow-lg&quot;: &quot;0 10px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1)&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"color-text-primary\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"#0f172a\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"color-text-secondary\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"#475569\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"color-text-disabled\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"#94a3b8\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"color-bg-default\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"#ffffff\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"color-bg-subtle\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"#f8fafc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"color-bg-inverse\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"#0f172a\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"color-border-default\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"#e2e8f0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"color-border-focus\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"#3b82f6\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"space-xs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"4px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"space-sm\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"8px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"space-md\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"16px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"space-lg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"24px\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"space-xl\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-d